RES osdtriplet
! ---- FNO: CODE V image-space F/number, held ----
! Bare FNO reports the current image-space F/# (-1/(2u') of the marginal ray).
FNO
! FNO 4 holds F/4: the entrance pupil becomes EFL/4 at once (12.5027 here).
FNO 4
FNO
FIR
! The hold survives lens changes (thickness, then radius): F/4 throughout,
! the pupil follows.  (A thickness change before a radius change once
! collapsed the pupil to 0 -- the paraxial launch must treat a held F/# as
! an EPD-defined pupil.)
THI S2 3.2
RDY S1 18
FIR
! Saved as EPD (current pupil) in the lens block plus FNO after GO; the
! restored lens keeps the hold.
SAV fnotest
RES osdtriplet
RES fnotest
FNO
RDY S1 15
FIR
! CODE V export/import: CV2PRG applies the FNO once the lens is built.
ZOA2CV fnotest.seq
RES osdtriplet
CV2PRG fnotest.seq
FNO
! EPD replaces the held F/#: the pupil stays 12 and the F/# now varies.
EPD 12
FNO
RDY S1 18
FIR
! Bad input
FNO 0
FNO abc
